# Avlon packages are published to and installed from Azure Artifacts ONLY.
# npmjs stays reachable as the feed's UPSTREAM for third-party dependencies;
# it is never a source or a target for an @avlon package.
#
# This line is the control, not `publishConfig.registry`: for a scoped package
# npm resolves the publish target from @scope:registry, which outranks both
# publishConfig and an explicit --registry flag (measured on npm 11.16.0).
#
# No credentials here. CI writes a token to a userconfig outside the checkout;
# a developer authenticates to the feed with their own userconfig.
@avlon:registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/avlon/_packaging/continuum/npm/registry/
